{"id": "port-rent-arrears-and-collections", "title": "San Francisco’s Port expected to collect $11.9 million of $24.5 million overdue", "seconds": 65.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.098, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "f2c7669050c11778", "words": 194, "beats": [{"scene": "ledger", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In August 2021, the Port reported outstanding balances across 453 lease agreements.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.57, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "much", "overdue", "rent", "could", "the", "Port", "collect?"], "sub": "San Francisco waterfront leases"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.67, 1.39, 1.53, 1.81, 2.23, 2.76, 3.24, 3.55, 3.77, 4.03, 4.56, 4.78]}, {"scene": "ledger", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Port estimated it could collect $11.9 million of a $24.5 million balance.", "t0": 5.69, "t1": 11.32, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "August 2021 portfolio estimate", "heading": "Outstanding and collectible", "source": "arrears", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "Outstanding net of credits", "value": "$24.5 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Estimated collectible", "value": "$11.9 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.36, 0.86, 0.98, 1.14, 1.44, 1.78, 2.02, 2.21, 2.5, 3.22, 3.39, 3.46, 4.02, 4.27, 4.53, 4.78, 5.08]}, {"scene": "ledger", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Twenty-four agreements accounted for $17.1 million of the outstanding balance.", "t0": 11.44, "t1": 15.84, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "During the pandemic"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.89, 1.28, 1.43, 1.92, 2.2, 2.43, 2.77, 3.13, 3.22, 3.31, 3.86]}, {"scene": "ledger", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2024, Port staff cited collections workload and the risk of letting claims expire.", "t0": 15.96, "t1": 21.11, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "staffing", "kicker": "Port of San Francisco", "text": "2024 collections staffing request", "mark": "2024 collections staffing request"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 1.39, 1.71, 2.03, 2.32, 2.76, 3.38, 3.59, 3.69, 3.93, 4.02, 4.26, 4.6]}, {"scene": "ledger", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The request did not identify individual debts that had expired.", "t0": 21.23, "t1": 24.11, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Staffing request"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.61, 0.77, 1.26, 1.73, 2.0, 2.14, 2.26]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The later audited accounts report customer and tenant receivables of $29.428 million.", "t0": 24.33, "t1": 30.47, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit25", "kicker": "Port of San Francisco / independent auditor", "text": "FY2025 audited accounts", "mark": "FY2025 audited accounts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.49, 0.88, 1.59, 1.97, 2.45, 2.59, 2.91, 3.55, 3.69, 4.26, 4.51, 4.74, 4.99, 5.22, 5.54]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The allowance covered all receivables. That total included grants as well as tenant accounts.", "t0": 30.59, "t1": 35.68, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "FY2025 audited accounts", "heading": "The allowance covered several kinds of receivable", "source": "audit25", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "All receivables", "value": "$33.362 million"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Allowance", "value": "$17.718 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.53, 0.85, 1.1, 2.19, 2.47, 2.86, 3.24, 3.6, 3.74, 3.92, 4.05, 4.37]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "One tenant file gives an actual disposition. Alioto paid $250,000 and forfeited its deposit.", "t0": 35.8, "t1": 41.98, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "alioto", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Alioto lease termination", "mark": "Alioto lease termination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.51, 0.79, 0.98, 1.09, 1.45, 2.76, 3.29, 3.51, 3.69, 3.92, 4.19, 4.51, 4.83, 4.98, 5.48, 5.65]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Port waived $861,427 in rent and late fees in the mutual termination.", "t0": 42.1, "t1": 48.95, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$861,427", "label": "Unpaid rent and late fees waived in the termination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.84, 1.26, 1.49, 1.87, 2.41, 2.92, 3.13, 3.46, 3.97, 4.29, 4.41, 4.93, 5.19, 5.44, 5.79, 5.87, 5.97, 6.29]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Port opened a public plaza on the old restaurant site in September 2026.", "t0": 49.07, "t1": 53.33, "shot": "plazabuilt", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The former restaurant site"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.72, 0.79, 1.11, 1.54, 1.64, 1.74, 1.94, 2.35, 2.62, 2.78, 3.22, 3.5]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The plaza construction award was $3.87 million. Demolition had its own contract.", "t0": 53.45, "t1": 58.63, "shot": "plazacost", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3.87 million", "label": "Plaza construction award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.41, 0.89, 1.18, 1.34, 1.56, 1.77, 1.97, 2.25, 2.53, 3.63, 4.17, 4.3, 4.42, 4.59]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "A current rent aging schedule would show how much tenant debt was overdue.", "t0": 58.75, "t1": 62.38, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Rent aging", "Collection"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.68, 0.97, 1.35, 1.52, 1.75, 1.88, 2.08, 2.48, 2.72, 2.89]}, {"scene": "accounts", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 62.5, "t1": 64.67, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.66, 0.86, 1.15, 1.26, 1.36, 1.6, 1.83]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"ledger": "What did the Port expect to collect?", "accounts": "What the next report measured"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "question"}